"withdraw from this contract by an unequivocal statement (for example a "
"letter sent by post, fax or email)."
msgstr ""
"如需行使撤回合同的权利，您必须通过明确的声明（例如邮寄信函、传真或电子邮件）"
"告知我们您撤回本合同的决定。"

#: src/Service/AnnexGeneratorService.php:68
